                          <SHORT-NAME>ArtiOsAlarmInstanceValidRef</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Refers to the ArtiObjectInstanceParameter that contains the evaluation for the "validity" of this alarm. Every object declaration may contain a VALID attribute telling the debugger whether the object's attributes are currently valid. It may have an integer type of any size. Its possible values are 0 (invalid) and non zero (object is valid).</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Arti_00118</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
